Description: ParsLinux NVIDIA graphics driver installer and GPU manager
 A graphical tool that helps you install and manage NVIDIA GPU drivers
 on ParsLinux. It detects your hardware, suggests fitting proprietary
 or open-source drivers, integrates official repositories, and manages
 secondary GPUs on hybrid laptops.
